    <li><a href="/guide/get-cited-by-chatgpt">How ChatGPT picks which brands to recommend</a></li>
    <li><a href="/guide/brand-entity-setup">Brand entity setup: the single biggest AEO lever</a></li>
  </ul>

</GuideLayout>
